{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_123_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，王正月，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"二、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"三、夏，仲孫蔑如京師。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"四、齊侯伐萊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"五、秋，取根牟。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"六、八月，滕子卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"七、九月，晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯會於扈。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"八、晉荀林父帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"九、辛酉，晉侯黑臀卒於扈。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"其地，於外也。其日，未踰竟也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"十、冬，十月，癸酉，衞侯鄭卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"十一、宋人圍滕。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"十二、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"十三、晉郤缺帥師救鄭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"十四、陳殺其大夫泄冶。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_123_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_123","textTraditional":"稱國以殺其大夫，殺無罪也。泄冶之無罪如何？陳靈公通於夏徵舒之家。公孫寧、儀行父亦通其家。或衣其衣，或衷其襦，以相戲於朝。泄冶聞之，入諫曰：「使國人聞之則猶可，使仁人聞之則不可。」君愧於泄冶，不能用其言而殺之。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}